  "notes": {
    "title": "Summons stay between encounters",
    "summary": "Your summons now stay with you between encounters instead of disappearing after rewards.",
    "changes": [
      "Surviving allied summons keep their HP and remaining lifetime through rewards, corridor travel and dungeon transitions, including saved transitions.",
      "Reward pauses and travel no longer consume summon duration. Dead or expired summons still disappear, and summons clear when a run ends.",
      "Updated optional playtest-session reporting."
    ]
